Determine and explain the functionality of the following code fragment and write the output of any sample input.

```c
void Funtion1(int a[], int n)
{
for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i += 2)
{
int temp = a[i];
a[i] = a[i + 1];
a[i + 1] = temp;
}
}
```

